>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />Also, <math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math><br />So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msub><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msub><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><msub><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi>